<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νό-ησις</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶσις</span></b>  Timo <i><span class="en">
			44.2
		</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ἡ</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>intelligence, understanding,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴσθησις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Diog.Apoll.
				3
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				28a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοήσει καὶ οὐκ ὄμμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					529b
				</span></i>
			; superior to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάνοια,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				511d
			</span></i>; including <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμη</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάνοια,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				534a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ νοῦς εἷς καὶ συνεχὴς ὥσπερ ἡ ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					407a7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. νοήσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1074b34
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>processes of thought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>de An.</u>
				407a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				917a39
			</span></i>, Timol.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			concrete, <i>idea, concept,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κοινὴ τοῦ θεοῦ ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3p.59U.
				</span></i>
			</div>
